  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.4.2-beta.6`\n\n### Features\n\n- enhance window blur support for Windows with configurable materials and update related settings ([271c4da1](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/271c4da16acbdbbb87ba2ad4a2253e0ca2cc793c))\n- add macOS window background blur feature with configurable radius and opacity ([81910db4](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/81910db4040d059fc6f07fe6ad6cab66983b75cc))\n- implement SSH agent forwarding support and update related configurations ([bba30110](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/bba30110eb6b7b438e27ca7bd6aa27ac308ffde3))\n\n### Other changes\n\n- upgrade frontend majors (react 19, typescript 6, eslint 10, vitest 5, i18next 26, lucide 1, dockview 8) ([d89e31e4](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/d89e31e4c8a0f5d4b3e72137d65741e285803c6f))\n- upgrade eslint-plugin-react-hooks to 7.1.1 and fix its violations ([f81daec1](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/f81daec1dbc98563f35135fb2fd3eed643b07dfa))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.4.2-beta.6...v0.4.2-beta.7](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.4.2-beta.6...v0.4.2-beta.7)\n",
